<Base title="About Card Stockist" description="Who runs Card Stockist, how store details are checked, and how NZ stores can get listed or featured." crumbs={[{ name: 'About', href: '/about/' }]}>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About Card Stockist</h1>
    <!-- SAM: replace this paragraph with your collecting story and a photo or two of your own cards. -->
    <p>Card Stockist is run by a New Zealand collector who got tired of checking a dozen store websites to find out who had stock. It lists every NZ trading card store in one place, with the games they carry, whether they sell singles, and when new sets land here.</p>

    <h2>How store details are checked</h2>
    <p>Every listing is checked against the store's own website or listing, and each profile shows the date it was last checked. We only list a game, singles or events when we've seen evidence of it. Stock changes daily, so always check with the store before you visit.</p>

    <h2 id="listing">Store owners: get listed or updated</h2>
    <p>Listings are free and every NZ store gets one. If your store is missing or something's out of date, email <a href="mailto:hello@cardstockist.com">hello@cardstockist.com</a> and we'll fix it.</p>
    <p>Featured placement (top of your city page and the where-to-buy pages) is available and always labelled "Featured".</p>

    <h2>Independence</h2>
    <p>Card Stockist isn't affiliated with The Pokémon Company, Bandai or any other publisher. Featured stores pay for placement, and that never changes the free listings.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
